in their tracks.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/35a102c4e8c43e5bfc0efc1d7fab95e6.poster.avif?t=1716977886\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/35a102c4e8c43e5bfc0efc1d7fab95e6.webm?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/35a102c4e8c43e5bfc0efc1d7fab95e6.mp4?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Step into the ultimate showdown, where precision triumphs over speed, and victory is achieved by fewest shots. Scope out the course with the exclusive aerial camera, and hit your ball further than before with the combined power dash mechanic. Put your golfing skills to the test in casual or custom games!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/03471241c2e04bc96a3ab44822a1065b.poster.avif?t=1716977886\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/03471241c2e04bc96a3ab44822a1065b.webm?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/03471241c2e04bc96a3ab44822a1065b.mp4?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Race against the clock to earn stars and unlock new courses! Compare your best time on each course against those of your friends, or secure your place on the global leaderboards!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/f46e1e287506d42fb3813abd48715066.poster.avif?t=1716977886\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/f46e1e287506d42fb3813abd48715066.webm?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/f46e1e287506d42fb3813abd48715066.mp4?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control the way you play by equipping unique Power Cores to suit your playstyle. Hit your ball with more power, spin, or bounciness, whilst using powerful abilities to grapple onto, freeze or stick to your ball. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/c43a527a3e34bc07961b3dee0314cab5.poster.avif?t=1716977886\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/c43a527a3e34bc07961b3dee0314cab5.webm?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/c43a527a3e34bc07961b3dee0314cab5.mp4?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stand out from the crowd in your personalised vehicle. Enjoy over 1 trillion different combinations with customisable car bodies, balls, wheels, spoilers, shields, paints and boosters!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/cbcd52ff6a351299d323dc66f884cd1d.poster.avif?t=1716977886\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/cbcd52ff6a351299d323dc66f884cd1d.webm?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1324350/extras/cbcd52ff6a351299d323dc66f884cd1d.mp4?t=1716977886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use your wings, wheels and wit to navigate the terrain, taking advantage of boost pads and boost rings, while avoiding rough, bunkers and trees! Journey through unique biomes, including ancient Aztec temples, gravity defying space courses and industrial wastelands!","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Racing","Sports"],"developers":["Hugecalf Studios"],"publishers":["Hugecalf Studios"],"release_date":"4 Apr, 2024"}